  "description": "DynamicPDF Viewer is a PDF viewing control you can embed in a .NET Windows Form application. Viewer is highly efficient and lightweight and can add PDF viewing to any WinForm application without relying on any third party or external resources.\n\nDynamicPDF Viewer for .NET seamlessly integrates with our other DynamicPDF products allowing applications to display PDF output from any of our other DynamicPDF tools (but will work with any PDF file regardless of producer). It is compatible with PDF version v1.1 to v1.7.\n\nDynamicPDF Viewer is backed by a great team of developers and support staff. Flexible licensing (including royalty free) is available to mee t all your needs.\n\nRelease Notes:\n\n* Fixed an AccessViolationException issue when loading and scrolling pages in DynamicPDF Viewer.\n* Resolved an issue where the Viewer application would hang when attempting to highlight a search item with an empty string or space.",
